6025,English,"Sievern and Knoxville Railroad, a South Carolina railroad that runs for about 17.5 miles, was incorporated by the South Carolina General Assembly in which it was given the property for the Greenwood, Anderson and Western Railway in 1898 and was later on controlled by the Southern Railway after 1899.","दक्षिण क्यारोलिनाको करिब १७.५ माइल लामो 'सिभर्न एन्ड नक्सभिल रेलरोड' (Sievern and Knoxville Railroad) लाई दक्षिण क्यारोलिनाको महासभा (General Assembly) ले सन् १८९८ मा 'ग्रीनवुड, एन्डरसन एन्ड वेस्टर्न रेलवे' को सम्पत्ति हस्तान्तरण गर्दै निगमित गरेको थियो र पछि सन् १८९९ देखि यसको नियन्त्रण 'सदर्न रेलवे' (Southern Railway) ले गरेको थियो।",True,False,False,Incorrect,Wrong TRUE/FALSE prediction,True,Incorrect,False
