10595,English,"The expression ""boots on the ground"" has an extended military-jargon history and certainly dates back at least to British officer Robert Grainger Ker Thompson, strategist of the British counter-insurgency efforts against the Malayan National Liberation Army during the Malayan Emergency, a guerrilla war fought in the Federation of Malaya from 1948 until 1960.","चेला चोइले महिला PGA च्याम्पियनशिपमा अमेरिकी महिला ओपन भन्दा बढी सहभागिता जनाए, जुन LPGA टूरका पाँच प्रमुख च्याम्पियनशिपहरू मध्ये सबैभन्दा पुरानो हो।",True,True,True,Correct,,False,Correct,False
