10697,English,"Ye Shuhua (born June 21, 1927 in Guangzhou, Guangdong, China) is a Chinese astronomer and professor at Shanghai Astronomical Observatory, known for achieving one of the world's most precise measurements of Universal Time in the 1960s who spent most of her school years during the Second Sino-Japanese War and had to move repeatedly with her family from Guangzhou to Hong Kong, Shaoguan, and Lian County, because of the war.","Walid Saud Abdullah, राष्ट्रिय रक्षा जिम्मेवारीमा राखिएका, भनी भन्नुभयो कि अस्थायी स्वतन्त्र Kuwait सरकारविरुद्ध दण्डात्मक उपायहरू अपनाउने देशहरूले सम्झनु पर्छ कि तिनीहरूको Kuwait मा स्वार्थ र नागरिकहरू छन्, र यदि ती देशहरूले Kuwait र Iraq विरुद्ध आक्रमणमा अडिग रहँछन् भने, Kuwaiti सरकारले ती देशहरूसँगको व्यवहारको तरिका पुनर्विचार गर्नेछ।",True,True,True,Correct,,False,Correct,False
